<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Comparison of attack success rates achieved by different jailbreak methods across a variety of state-of-the-art large language models on two widely used benchmark datasets, JailbreakBench and HarmBench. Higher values represent stronger attack performance, with bold numbers indicating the best result in each group.</figcaption>
