</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.4 </span>More Efficiency Analysis</h3>

<div id="A2.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To further clarify the average computational resources required per successful attack, we report the average number of model calls per successful sample on the HarmBench:</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T9" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T9.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T9.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T9.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"></th>
<th id="A2.T9.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">ASR (%)</th>
<th id="A2.T9.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Model Calls</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A2.T9.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
